The \BORLANDC\MEWEL directory contains several demos of the MEWEL User
Interface Library, a multi-platform UI which provides source code
compatibility between Windows, DOS text and DOS graphics. There are
three demos included :

  GUIDEMO  - a general purpose demo of the DOS graphics version of
             MEWEL. Included in the demo is a clone of the Windows
             CLOCK and bitmap manipulation. All Windows controls are
             demonstrated as well.
  TEXTDEMO - a general purpose demo of the text mode version of MEWEL
  CHECKERS - The OWL Checkers program running as a stand-alone DOS
             graphics program. Prooves that OWL is a multi-platform
             development tool.

To dearchive the MEWEL demos, use the following command :

  PKUNZIP MEWEL

